ve_node_pks`), Wisconsin patient benefit routing (`7` `active_node_pks`), one-click `PLAW-117-328` inquiry (`6` `active_node_pks`), and empty subgraph probes.\n   - Saved Payloads:\n     - [`assets/20261013T194318-162-mbmi/api_graphrag_query_illumination_probes.json`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-2-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/assets/20261013T194318-162-mbmi/api_graphrag_query_illumination_probes.json)\n     - [`assets/20261013T194318-162-mbmi/neo4j_canvas_illumination_alignment_audit.json`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-2-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/assets/20261013T194318-162-mbmi/neo4j_canvas_illumination_alignment_audit.json)\n\n---\n\n## 4. Explicit Deficiency Register Summary\n\nFull details are recorded in Section 4 of [`scan_report_009_plan_scan_2.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-2-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/scan_reports/scan_report_009_plan_scan_2.md):\n\n- **`DEF-001` (Primary Root Cause of Dormant Canvas State — [`GraphCanvas.tsx`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-2-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/components/GraphCanvas.tsx#L40-L81), lines 40–81, 314–316, 358–380):** The `useEffect` calling `frameActiveSubgraph(activeNodePKs)` (lines 77–81) runs **before** `renderRef.current = render` (lines 314–316) and **before** `zoomBehaviorRef.current = zoom` (lines 358–380), and `.on('zoom', ...)` calls `render()` directly from its closure instead of `renderRef.current()`. When a query finishes, `frameActiveSubgraph` starts the 350ms D3 transition on the **previous** `zoomBehaviorRef.current` instance whose `'zoom'` listener closes over the **stale pre-query `render` callback** (`isIlluminated === false`, `activeNodePKs` empty). Every animation frame of the 350ms camera transition and its final frame calls that stale `render()` closure, painting the canvas in its dormant unilluminated state until the user manually interacts with the canvas.\n- **`DEF-002` (Canvas Buffer Reallocation \u0026 `d3.zoom` Re-binding on Every State/Hover Change — [`GraphCanvas.tsx`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-2-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/components/GraphCanvas.tsx#L358-L396)):** Both the `d3.zoom` initialization and `window` resize `useEffect` hooks depend on `[render]`, reallocating `canvas.width` / `canvas.height` and re-binding `d3.select(canvas).call(zoom)` on every hover or state change, and lacking a `ResizeObserver` for container/panel resizes (Req 5.4, 6.5).\n- **`DEF-003` (Premature Camera Framing Before Force Simulation Initializes Coordinates — [`GraphCanvas.tsx`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-2-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/components/GraphCanvas.tsx#L44)):** When `nodes` are loaded/reloaded, Hook 1 (`frameActiveSubgraph`) runs before Hook 3 (`d3.forceSimulation(nodes)`), so `n.x` and `n.y` are `undefined` and `frameActiveSubgraph` exits early with `matchedNodes.length === 0`.\n- **`DEF-004` (Active Node Gold/Amber `#ffb703` Fill \u0026 `rgba(255, 183, 3, 0.45)` Radial Glow Halo — [`GraphCanvas.tsx`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-2-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/components/GraphCanvas.tsx#L225-L241)):** Line 239 fills nodes with `visual.badgeColor` rather than `#ffb703` (`CANVAS_PALETTE.accentAmber`) when `isActive` is true, and lines 226–234 draw only a solid `#f59e0b` ring rather than an active radial glow halo (`rgba(255, 183, 3, 0.45)`) as required by Req 4.1.3.\n- **`DEF-005` (Selected Node Highlighting \u0026 Attenuation During Illumination — [`GraphCanvas.tsx`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-2-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/components/GraphCanvas.tsx#L213-L234)):** Selected nodes not in `activeNodePKs` are dimmed to `0.18` opacity during illumination and share the same ring style as `isActive` rather than maintaining a distinctive selection ring and pulse effect (Req 4.4.1).\n- **`DEF-006` (De-Illumination Transition Interruption \u0026 Chat Inquiry Close Reset — [`GraphCanvas.tsx`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-2-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/components/GraphCanvas.tsx#L77-L81), [`AgentChatDrawer.tsx`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-2-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/components/AgentChatDrawer.tsx#L71-L82)):** Clearing illumination does not interrupt in-flight D3 zoom transitions (`d3.select(canvas).interrupt()`), and closing the chat inquiry drawer (`✕`) in `AgentChatDrawer.tsx` does not reset `isIlluminated` to `false` (Req 4.3.1, 4.3.2).\n- **`DEF-007` (Empty Subgraph Response Sets `isIlluminated = true` — [`GraphSyncContext.tsx`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-2-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/context/GraphSyncContext.tsx#L269-L273)):** `setIlluminatedPath` unconditionally sets `setIsIlluminated(true)` even when `response.active_node_pks` is empty, dimming the entire canvas to `0.18` opacity instead of clearing illumination (Req 5.3).\n- **`DEF-008` (Rapid Successive Queries Blocked — [`GraphSyncContext.tsx`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-2-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/frontend/src/context/GraphSyncContext.tsx#L343)):** `submitInquiry` drops new queries while `isQueryLoading` is `true` instead of allowing rapid successive queries to supersede in-flight requests and overwrite the active path (Req 5.1).\n- **`DEF-009` (Corrupted `\"RELATED_TO\"` Edge Keys in `active_edge_keys` — [`traversal.py`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-2-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/src/graphrag/traversal.py#L772-L800)):** Calling `.data()` on Neo4j results in `_execute_single_general_traversal`, `_execute_single_clinical_traversal`, `_execute_multi_entity_traversal`, `_execute_pattern_b`, and `_execute_pattern_c` serializes relationships as tuples lacking `.type`, causing `_convert_edge` to emit `\"-\u003eRELATED_TO-\u003e\"` keys that fail `activeEdgeKeys.has(link.edge_key)` on the canvas (Req 4.1.3).\n\n---\n\n## 5. Sufficiency \u0026 Scan Certification\n\n- **`{sufficient}` Certification:** The complete dependency cone and empirical payload schemas are documented and verified against live endpoints with zero ambiguity remaining.\n- **Handoff Manifest Affirmation:** [`handoff/20261013T194318-162-mbmi/plan-scan-2.txt`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-2-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/handoff/20261013T194318-162-mbmi/plan-scan-2.txt) was atomically overwritten with 45 verified repository-relative paths (qualified components, [`scan_reports/scan_report_009_plan_scan_2.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-scan-2-20261013T194318-162-mbmi/scan_reports/scan_report_009_plan_scan_2.md), and the 3 saved ground-truth payload files in `assets/20261013T194318-162-mbmi/`).\n\n---\n\n## 6. Coding Gate Affirmation\n\n*DO NOT CODE YET: Implementation coding gate remains locked. Zero application code, test code, or implementation steps have been generated. Coding waits on an empty frontier and explicit operator authorization.*\n\n\u003cpromise\u003eCOMPLETE\u003c/promise\u003e\n","error":"The stream was interrupted. Please continue the task you were working on.","duration_seconds":567.713661,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":422916,"output_tokens":47706,"thinking_tokens":20702,"cache_read_tokens":2620782,"total_tokens":470622}}}

